# The Ruinous Wrecking Crew at X = 1 chooses up to one mode, so two are refused, and "Destroy target token" cannot be chosen while no token
# is on the battlefield (CR 700.2a). It takes "Each player sacrifices a creature of their choice" (CR 701.21a, 101.4): Bot1's only creature is
# the Crew itself, and Bot2 gives up its Ornithopter.

